# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# What ci/fetch-msb.sh may install, by release tag: `<tag> <release asset> <sha256>`, or
# `<tag> source-commit <sha1>` for a fork tag whose Linux msb is built from source, and
# `<tag> libkrunfw-linux-version <x.y.z>`: the firmware version that msb looks for beside itself
# (`LIBKRUNFW_VERSION` in its `crates/utils/lib/lib.rs`). fetch-msb.sh
# refuses anything not listed here. Values copied from each release's checksums.sha256 and checked
# against a download.
#
# Fork tags (TijsVK/microsandbox, 2026-10-06). The tag's source commit pins the Linux build.
# Older tags stay listed so earlier commits still fetch their runtime (e.g. windows-e2e.ps1 -Bisect).
